ce even on a packed weekend\"","thumbnail":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVZlBYNouma6b4IhQO2vtkt8C_B_Epc85-mpWk-8O42TNpf1SpP=s40-k-cc-rp-mo"}],"most_relevant":[{"username":"Greeshma Bernad","rating":5,"contributor_id":"113195637062318249547","user_review_count":19,"user_photo_count":10,"user_thumbnail":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWSJbyjMkurohG0KqcDqJV-JqPbChvs4JSdYbqlKK79Vw1CkM8kcA=s120-c-rp-mo-ba12-br100","description":"Went with a group of friends and we all had a great time ! The place was spacious and crowd was great too. All the staff are very helpful and supportive. Special mention to two people.. first one is bouncer Tejas who always made sure we are safe and comfortable. He was  highly professional and very proactive in helping us . Another person is Ishita - she was always approachable in terms of providing any support and was very friendly.  Also, the staff at the bar counter were very approachable and friendly. DJ was amazing and the whole vibe was awesome. Would definitely visit again.","link":"https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pNeWJFRndjMUI1TjFkM1lYbzJhamh4WlZGdFpWRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x386887c10686e33a!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOjMybEFwc1B5N1d3YXo2ajhxZVFtZVE%7C%7C?hl=en-GB","images":[{"thumbnail":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/grass-cs/ACvplmMACgG1I_Z_YIS-av46VgLvFFKZ3rM4y5mDYQ1Agtacid7u00HP7vXflXMYflgUJUuVJMJk-HnVPcatsJuRZ5Stq7TKbGho4SDzwaUL0IekuqwAmOoJCvWaKR1WpVnZgRxYTCOw3dM7ONdV=k-no"},{"thumbnail":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/grass-cs/ACvplmNGJHs05H0ViDlMI69zNLV2o2HpiD_5bJ-pvUHjwSvEY5UrFc9PLvQsCoHTykkessyj-btlLKqaldLzCr3wTppqdoXUQfoce72V1fH6k6Zx7n0f53iiC0gCxLhUWqKEy2Jqk2iYTd-L8vW-=k-no"}],"date":"2 months ago","date_iso8601":"2026-08-05T00:58:03+00:00"},{"username":"Pawan Jaiswal","rating":5,"contributor_id":"117107310323616300672","user_review_count":23,"user_photo_count":276,"user_thumbnail":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVcq_ZRBFwBAceDPUiagEVO3oy7